Author: gopalaakkrishna <gopalaakkrishna@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Aug 18 18:19:56 2026 -0400

    Rework the type scale, fix contrast, remove a dead card
    
    Eleven font sizes with eight of them crammed between 8.3px and 15.2px meant
    the festival credential (.card-badge) rendered at 8.3px - the smallest type
    on the site carrying the strongest credit. Raises the floor to 11px across
    25 declarations and spreads the scale out; the badge gets padding to match.
    
    A second .g-cat rule in a later refinements block was overriding the first
    at .52rem, which is why the first pass appeared not to take.
    
    Fixes the only two WCAG AA failures: .sh-s (4.11:1) and .card-context
    (4.47:1), both against a 4.5:1 requirement. Every text node across all nine
    sections now passes.
    
    Two bugs: "Distribution Plans" was the only Production Docs card with no
    click handler, so it did nothing when clicked - removed. And the YouTube
    icon's SVG path had a C command with 4 of its required 6 parameters, which
    threw a console error on every page load.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

